    "answer": {
      "short": "Middle right: $3a+6b$; base middle: $4a+b$; base left: $2a-3b$. Subtract to find each missing lower brick.",
      "worked": "Middle right:\n$$\\begin{align*}(9a+4b)-(6a-2b)&=9a+4b-6a+2b\\\\&=3a+6b\\end{align*}$$\nBase middle:\n$$\\begin{align*}(3a+6b)-(-a+5b)&=3a+6b+a-5b\\\\&=4a+b\\end{align*}$$\nBase left:\n$$\\begin{align*}(6a-2b)-(4a+b)&=6a-2b-4a-b\\\\&=2a-3b\\end{align*}$$",
